## Reference Implementations (Python & Java)

```python
# Heartbeat TTL lease renewal loop (Python)
import time

def maintain_lease(registry, service_id: str, ttl_sec: int = 10):
    while True:
        registry.renew_lease(service_id, ttl=ttl_sec)
        time.sleep(ttl_sec / 3)
```

```java
// Heartbeat TTL lease renewal (Java)
scheduler.scheduleAtFixedRate(
    () -> registry.renewLease(serviceId, Duration.ofSeconds(10)),
    0, 3, TimeUnit.SECONDS
);
```
